{"id":"575d4fea7f098cfb","group":"29","path":"29/29-prop-advice-properties.md","title":"建议的一致性包含与不可判定语言","display":"prop-advice-properties — 建议的一致性包含与不可判定语言","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-prop-advice-properties","aliases":["29-prop-advice-properties"],"display":"prop-advice-properties — 建议的一致性包含与不可判定语言","depends_on":["[[29-df-computability]]","[[29-df-polynomial-advice]]"],"source_locator":"§11.3, p.177, DjVu scan192; Exercise11.18(1)","source_basis":"文本陈述已对照；单调性和一元不可判定语言给出本地一般证明","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-prop-advice-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-prop-advice-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-advice-properties — 建议的一致性包含与不可判定语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"166ecddb12d25dfc\" href=\"?note=166ecddb12d25dfc\" title=\"29-df-polynomial-advice\">29-df-polynomial-advice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§11.3, p.177, DjVu scan192; Exercise11.18(1)"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"文本陈述已对照；单调性和一元不可判定语言给出本地一般证明"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"166ecddb12d25dfc\" href=\"?note=166ecddb12d25dfc\" title=\"29-df-polynomial-advice\">29-df-polynomial-advice</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B,C/\\mathrm{poly},\\mathrm{PAdvice},\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}\">\\(\\mathbb B,C/\\mathrm{poly},\\mathrm{PAdvice},\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}\\)</span> 和配对编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1,C_2,D_1,D_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)\">\\(C_1,C_2,D_1,D_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a>，分别作用于自然数集和二进制语言。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)\\)</span>；最后一个蕴涵以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_1\\in C\">\\(K_1\\in C\\)</span> 为前提。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_H\">\\(h_H\\)</span> 的建议长度恰为1；并不假定它可计算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0,b_1\">\\(b_0,b_1\\)</span> 是下式给出的长度一的比特串，串的位置从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起编号；它们区别于自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>。配对编码的两个参数均为比特串。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_1\\subseteq C_2\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ C_1/\\mathrm{poly}\\subseteq C_2/\\mathrm{poly}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_1\\subseteq C_2\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ C_1/\\mathrm{poly}\\subseteq C_2/\\mathrm{poly}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_1\\subseteq D_2\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Unif}_{D_1}(C)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Unif}_{D_2}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_1\\subseteq D_2\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Unif}_{D_1}(C)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Unif}_{D_2}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_0\\coloneqq(0)_{i&lt;1}\\in\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad b_1\\coloneqq(1)_{i&lt;1}\\in\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad|b_0|=|b_1|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_0\\coloneqq(0)_{i&lt;1}\\in\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad b_1\\coloneqq(1)_{i&lt;1}\\in\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad|b_0|=|b_1|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_1\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0^n,b_1\\rangle\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad h_H:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad h_H(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b_1,&amp;n\\in H,\\\\b_0,&amp;n\\notin H,\\end{cases}\\qquad L_H\\coloneqq\\{0^n\\mid n\\in H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_1\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0^n,b_1\\rangle\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad h_H:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad h_H(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b_1,&amp;n\\in H,\\\\b_0,&amp;n\\notin H,\\end{cases}\\qquad L_H\\coloneqq\\{0^n\\mid n\\in H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_1\\in C\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\bigl(h_H\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\land L_H\\in C/\\mathrm{poly}\\land L_H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_1\\in C\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\bigl(h_H\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\land L_H\\in C/\\mathrm{poly}\\land L_H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前两式直接复用同一个建议函数和判定语言；不需要假定任何语言类的闭包。第三式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^n\">\\(0^n\\)</span> 只需正确建议的一位；含1的输入均拒绝。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_H\">\\(L_H\\)</span> 可判定，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^n\">\\(0^n\\)</span> 并调用该判定机即可判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>，矛盾。构造时间可能依 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 很大，但可判定性不设资源界。</p>\n<p>原书p177指出非一致类可含不可判定语言。本条给出完全显式的见证，条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_1\\in C\">\\(K_1\\in C\\)</span> 避免对任意空类也声称这一结论。未声称所有语言均可由多项式建议判定，也未声称上述语言属于某个已经选定的一致电路类。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-computability","status":"resolved","id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-computability]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-polynomial-advice","status":"resolved","id":"166ecddb12d25dfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-polynomial-advice]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-polynomial-advice","status":"resolved","id":"166ecddb12d25dfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[29-df-polynomial-advice]] 的 $\\mathbb B,C/\\mathrm{poly},\\mathrm{PAdvice},\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}$ 和配对编码。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-computability","status":"resolved","id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_1,C_2,D_1,D_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)$；$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 满足 $H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}$、$\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}$ 取 [[29-df-computability]]，分别作用于自然数集和二进制语言。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B,C/\\mathrm{poly},\\mathrm{PAdvice},\\operatorname{Unif}_{D}","display":false},{"tex":"C_1,C_2,D_1,D_2\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^*)","display":false},{"tex":"K_1\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"h_H","display":false},{"tex":"b_0,b_1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"C_1\\subseteq C_2\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ C_1/\\mathrm{poly}\\subseteq C_2/\\mathrm{poly}.","display":true},{"tex":"D_1\\subseteq D_2\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Unif}_{D_1}(C)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Unif}_{D_2}(C).","display":true},{"tex":"b_0\\coloneqq(0)_{i<1}\\in\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad b_1\\coloneqq(1)_{i<1}\\in\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad|b_0|=|b_1|=1.","display":true},{"tex":"K_1\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0^n,b_1\\rangle\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad h_H:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad h_H(n)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b_1,&n\\in H,\\\\b_0,&n\\notin H,\\end{cases}\\qquad L_H\\coloneqq\\{0^n\\mid n\\in H\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"K_1\\in C\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\bigl(h_H\\in\\mathrm{PAdvice}\\land L_H\\in C/\\mathrm{poly}\\land L_H\\notin\\mathrm{DEC}_{\\mathbb B}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"0^n","display":false},{"tex":"L_H","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0^n","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"K_1\\in C","display":false}],"bytes":3068,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-polynomial-advice]]、[[29-prop-advice-properties]] — 多项式建议、受限一致性及不可判定语言见证"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-prop-advice-properties]]"}],"outgoing":["a1f1e7424c0c2277","166ecddb12d25dfc"]}